Subject: [M155] Ensure extensions only install into their own directory

Original change's description:
> Ensure extensions only install into their own directory
>
> Updates file_util::InstallExtension and file_util::GetInstallTempDir to
> verify that both the extension install destination (extensions_dir/id)
> and install temp directory (extensions_dir/Temp) resolve strictly to
> their expected child directories under the extensions root, rejecting
> symbolic links and NTFS junction reparse points. Path normalization and
> Windows fallback logic (e.g. for ramdisks) are shared with
> ExtensionResource via a new file_util::NormalizeFilePath helper.
>
> Because ChromeOS unpacks extensions inside the profile rather than
> %TEMP%, this stricter validation also requires ExtensionUpdaterTest to
> properly initialize TestExtensionSystem via Init() instead of passing an
> empty install directory to CreateExtensionService().
>
> Fixed: 561892119
